# =============================================================================
# space.env — TEMPLATE (no real values) — fill from your own accounts.
#
#   *** SECRETS INSIDE — NEVER COMMIT THIS FILE. It is in .gitignore. ***
#
# Use: copy each line into the Hugging Face Space -> Settings -> Variables and
# secrets (keys with tokens/passwords/URLs as SECRETS, the rest as Variables).
# The container also boots from defaults for everything not listed here
# (see space/entrypoint.sh). Full instructions: HF-Deployment-Guide.docx.
#
# NOT carried over on purpose (the Space sets its own):
#   SERVICE_NAME / HOST / PORT       -> fixed by space/supervisord.conf
#   APP_ENV / DATABASE_SSL / POOL    -> production / require / 3 (entrypoint)
#   CORS / APP_BASE_URL / *_LINK_BASE_URL -> default to the Space URL
#   GOOGLE_OAUTH_REDIRECT_URI        -> must be re-registered for the Space URL
# =============================================================================

